      ["Asked about the hurricane that destroyed his roof, he said, 'It was a bit breezy.'", "Understatement", "عاصفة مدمّرة وُصفت بكلمات صغيرة"],
      ["A traffic officer receives a parking ticket outside the police station.", "Irony", "الواقع عكس المتوقع"],
      ["A waiter slips and the tray of cakes flies into the air.", "Slapstick", "فكاهة جسدية بلا كلام"],
      ["'We knead you' is written above the bakery door.", "Wordplay (pun)", "knead تشبه need في النطق"],
      ["'I am perfectly calm,' he said without a smile, as the smoke alarm screamed above his head.", "Deadpan", "جدّية الوجه تقابل الموقف المضحك"]
